    {
      "id": "b_intro",
      "type": "prose",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "kind": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Korea born, England raised, San Francisco based. Philosophy, Politics and Economics major at Warwick, spent two years carrying a machine gun for the Korean Missile Command, and spent a decade exploring how companies get built, bought, and sold — Tech M&A at SVB and Moelis, then CoS at Artie."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "kind": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm interested in arts, technology, philosophy, and the strange business of figuring out what makes a life meaningful. I'm particularly drawn to philosophy through film — the kind of movies that leave you baffled, then send you down an endless maze of questions. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Mulholland Drive, Get Out, Inception,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Coco"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " are a few favorites."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "kind": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Manchester United fan since 2007. Golfer since age 2, though the evidence remains inconclusive."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
